.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH vmexec-ps 1  "ps " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
vmexec\-ps \- List virtual machines
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBvmexec ps\fR [\fB\-a\fR|\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
List virtual machines
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-a\fR, \fB\-\-all\fR
Show all the virtual machines, default is only running virtual machines
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
